  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>On comparing,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
